{title: Shield Around Me}
{subtitle: Psalms 3:3–4}
{key: Bb}
{tempo: 128}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Bb6] | [Gm7] | [Cm7] [F7] | [Dm7] [G7] |
| [Cm7] [F7] | [Bb6] [Gm7] | [Cm7] [F7] | [Dm7] [G7] |
| [Cm7] [F7] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb6]Ma[Gm7]ny foes have [Cm7]risen up a[F7]gainst me
[Dm7]Voic[G7]es claim [Cm7]there is no help [F7]in God
[Bb6]They [Gm7]crowd in on ev[Cm7]ery side I [F7]see
But I [Dm7]know the [G7]truth in the [Cm7]heart of the [F7]Lord
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Bb6]But [Gm7]you Lord are a [Cm7]shield a[F7]round me
[Dm7]My glo[G7]ry and the [Cm7]one who lifts my [F7]head [Bb6]high
[Gm7]You are [Cm7]the strength when [F7]I am weak
[Dm7][G7]My refuge in the [Cm7]dark [F7]and the [Bb]light [Gm7][Cm7][F7]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Bb6]I call a[Gm7]loud to the [Cm7]Lord for [F7]help
[Dm7]He answers [G7]me from his [Cm7]holy moun[F7]tain
[Bb6]My [Gm7]heart finds rest [Cm7]in His firm [F7]grip
The [Dm7]truth that is [G7]certain [Cm7]and un[F7]shaken
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Bb6]But [Gm7]you Lord are a [Cm7]shield a[F7]round me
[Dm7]My glo[G7]ry and the [Cm7]one who lifts my [F7]head [Bb6]high
[Gm7]You are the [Cm7]strength when I [F7]am weak
[Dm7]My [G7]refuge in the [Cm7]dark [F7]and the [Bb]light [Gm7][Cm7][F7]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Eb]I lie down and [Bb/D]sleep in peace
[Cm7]I wake again be[Bb]cause He [Fm7]sustains me
[Eb]I will not [Bb/D]fear the thousands a[Cm7]round
For His [F7]hand holds me se[Bb]curely [Gm7][Cm7][F7]
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Bb]But [Gm7]you Lord are a [Cm7]shield a[F7]round me
[Dm7]My glo[G7]ry and the [Cm7]one who lifts my [F7]head [Bb]high
[Gm7]You are the [Cm7]strength when I [F7]am weak
[Dm7]My [G7]refuge in the [Cm7]dark [F7]and the [Bb]light
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Outro (instrumental)}
| [Bb] [Gm7] | [Cm7] [F7] | [Dm7] [G7] | [Cm7] [F7] |

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[Gm7]You are my [Cm7]shield a[F7]round me
[Dm7]My glo[G7]ry and my head [Cm7]lifted [Bb]high
{end_of_verse}

{comment: Outro (instrumental)}
| [Gm7] | [Cm7] [F7] | [Dm7] [G7] | [Cm7] [F7] |
| [Bb] | [Bb] | [Bb] |
